== C2: mollifier/convexity density exponent is neutral exactly at sigma=theta ==
  identity bracket == 2(th+d-1/2)(th-sigma) on 2000 random rationals: True
  => N(sigma,T) exponent = 1 + 2A(theta - sigma): < 1 only for sigma > theta, for every mollifier length X=T^A
